thub_link":"https://github.com/hclivess/nado/commit/abb2968b5697da72bcea1e277fa7c65b8146b818","commit_subject":"node: TWO chain-safety fixes. (1) HALT FIX — _candidate_pool() now excludes already-mined txids: a sync donor re-injecting a mined tx into the pool got it selected into our own block candidate, then verify_block dropped it AFTER the block was hashed, so save_block refused it and the node wedged on one height forever (the 'Block N replays already-mined tx' loop). (2) ROLLING-MODE CONTRACT SAFETY — prune_block_bodies never deletes a body carrying a 'blob' tx: the exec node reads contract deploys/calls straight from block bodies as it tails, so pruning a blob body before a lagging/cold-starting exec node consumes it lost that contract forever; blob-bearing bodies are now retained (indexes + state always were)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"elizaOS/eliza","commit_timestamp":"2026-07-11T03:40:14Z","branch":"develop","commit_sha":"93b54e2e0688f00024c842d831bd08df689997b5","github_link":"https://github.com/elizaOS/eliza/commit/93b54e2e0688f00024c842d831bd08df689997b5","commit_subject":"fix(cloud): make tier-upgrade single-flight span target creation through provision enqueue (v2) (#16072)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"israel-dryer/ttkbootstrap","commit_timestamp":"2026-07-11T03:38:37Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"ba2d45b824a1e75367864d4aec9113cfec9bb864","github_link":"https://github.com/israel-dryer/ttkbootstrap/commit/ba2d45b824a1e75367864d4aec9113cfec9bb864","commit_subject":"docs: reformat theme-aware example for readability","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"dromara/liteflow","commit_timestamp":"2026-07-11T03:37:56Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"6174926a806035f0852d3194e3bc4d426e11145e","github_link":"https://github.com/dromara/liteflow/commit/6174926a806035f0852d3194e3bc4d426e11145e","commit_subject":"feat(rule-db-redis): 模块骨架 + Redisson 连接管理（single/sentinel/cluster 自动识别）","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"flagos-ai/FlagGems","commit_timesta